# VFS_PRODUCT_MAPPING_HARDENING.todo
# Sprint Execution File — Automated Semantic VFS Mapping & Validation
# Agent: SWE | Risk: Zero Regression
# Objective: Hardening the automated VFS mapping script and its verification suite. Address semantic trait matching failures, fix destructive GROQ query parsing errors, and establish resilient VFS Sub-Tree querying for seamless product placement.

---

## Global Directives

- Final code output must contain ZERO comments.
- Follow Fibonacci-based difficulty: 1, 2, 3, 5, 8.
- The VFS invariant must hold: A product's `catalogueLocationKeys` must ONLY contain IDs of `type: "link"` nodes.
- Sanity operations must use transactional updates (patch + unset + set) to ensure atomic success.

---

## Layer 1: Enhanced Semantic Trait Engine

### Scope Contract
Fix the brittle `.includes()` logic in the trait mapping engine. The `index.mjs` script must utilize a semantic keyword dictionary to map abstract product features (e.g., "integrated amplifier", "d/a conversion") into standard VFS leaf nodes (e.g., "Desktop Amps", "DAC/Amp Combos"). The product's `name` and `overviewFields` must be parsed as a unified knowledge string.

### DoD

- [ ] 1.1 — In `scripts/product-vfs-mapper/index.mjs`: Introduce a robust `semanticMap` dictionary mapping standard VFS leaf slugs (e.g., `desktop-amps`) to an array of semantic keywords (`['integrated amplifier', 'amp', 'receiver']`).
  - Difficulty: 3 - C(scripts/product-vfs-mapper/index.mjs): implement semantic keyword dictionary

- [ ] 1.2 — In `scripts/product-vfs-mapper/index.mjs`: Update `fetchProductTraits(productId)` to securely retrieve the product `name` and all `overviewFields`, concatenated into a lowercased "knowledge string".
  - Difficulty: 2 - C(scripts/product-vfs-mapper/index.mjs): generate unified product knowledge string

- [ ] 1.3 — In `scripts/product-vfs-mapper/index.mjs`: Standardize `determineLeafNodeIds(leafNodes, knowledgeString)` to iterate through `leafNodes`, checking if the `title` or any `semanticMap` keywords intersect with the `knowledgeString`.
  - Difficulty: 3 - A(scripts/product-vfs-mapper/index.mjs): implement intersection-based matching logic

- [ ] 1.4 — Ensure the engine returns a deduplicated array of string `_id` values strictly for `type: "link"` leaf nodes.
  - Difficulty: 1 - E(scripts): ensure deduplication and type safety

### Verification — Layer 1

- [ ] V1.1 — Run `node scripts/product-vfs-mapper/index.mjs --dry-run --productId="Y7l1IhzX2fnyiano4ius6H"`.
- [ ] V1.2 — Confirm the script output exactly includes `o37u0yjphzt3qu91ewnww2yj` (DAC/Amp Combos) and `o6mz3kbs5xla8ixastppktsd` (Desktop Amps).
  - Difficulty: 1

